# Moddy Arena: a ten-wave battle with its two boss waves. He sets WAVES to 10 on the control panel and starts the
# battle. Waves 1 to 4 are the rules file's; wave 5 is a boss wave: "BOSS WAVE" on the screen, Rumble the Ravager (a
# named ravager with 150 health) and a small escort, and the boss bar shows the boss's health (one bar, purple: not the
# wave's count). Waves 6 to 9 are made by the generator (more monsters, new kinds: piglin brutes from wave 7); wave 10
# is the second boss, Captain Chop (a big vindicator with 200 health). He wins: "All 10 waves cleared".
# A resistance effect keeps him on his feet; the monsters are removed by command (the fighting itself is
# 4-battle-won's).
# play-timeout: 900
@intent with WAVES at 10 a battle has boss waves at 5 and 10, each with a named boss, a boss bar for its health and a BOSS WAVE title, generated waves between, and beating wave 10 wins
@world flat seed=1

@step he arrives and sets ten waves
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
# this playtest proves the plain wave table (its kinds, the generator, the bosses): wished waves off for it
moddy arena config main wishedWaves off
@expect chat wishedWaves for main is now off within 5s
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 900 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 900 0 true
scoreboard objectives add arenatest dummy
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 15t
@wait 1s
@aim pos -0.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Waves: 10. A boss comes every 5th wave. within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_waves_value,nbt={text:{text:"10"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_first_wave,nbt={text:{text:"First wave: 3 monsters"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_means,nbt={text:{text:"Boss waves: 5, 10\nHotbar wishes: 5 a wave"}}]

@step he starts the battle
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting! 10 waves of monsters within 5s
@expect chat You each have 3 lives within 1s
@expect title Wave 1 of 10 within 15s

@step waves 1 to 4
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s
@expect title Wave 2 of 10 within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 3 of 10 within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 4 of 10 within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 4 cleared within 10s
@expect bossbar BOSS wave 5 of 10 in within 3s

@step wave 5 is a boss wave: Rumble the Ravager, its health on the boss bar
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 20s
@expect chat Wave 5 is a boss wave: Rumble the Ravager is here! within 3s
@wait 1s
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave,name="Rumble the Ravager"]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave,name="Rumble the Ravager"]
execute store result score #hp arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave,name="Rumble the Ravager",limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #hp arenatest matches 150
# the escort: a third of wave 5 (a husk, a pillager, a witch and a vindicator)
execute store result score #n arenatest if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,type=!minecraft:ravager,tag=!moddyarena_champion]
@assert execute if score #n arenatest matches 4
@expect bossbar BOSS: Rumble the Ravager (wave 5 of 10) within 3s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"BOSS wave 5 of 10!"}}]
# the boss hurt a little, so its bar is seen going down. The picture: from inside the arena, the wave held still
# (no AI) so it stays in view, and after the chat has faded
damage @e[type=minecraft:ravager,name="Rumble the Ravager",limit=1] 40 minecraft:player_attack
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
execute as @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
teleport @e[type=minecraft:ravager,name="Rumble the Ravager",limit=1] 0.5 64 2.5 0 0
teleport @s 0.5 64 13.5 180 5
@wait 12s
@expect bossbar BOSS: Rumble the Ravager (wave 5 of 10) within 3s
@shot boss-wave

@step the boss beaten, the bar shows the escort
kill @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat You beat Rumble the Ravager! within 3s
@expect bossbar Wave 5 of 10: 4 monsters left within 3s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 5 cleared within 10s

@step waves 6 to 9 are made by the generator: more monsters, and piglin brutes from wave 7
@expect title Wave 6 of 10 within 50s
@wait 1s
execute store result score #n arenatest if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if score #n arenatest matches 11
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 7 of 10 within 20s
@wait 1s
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:piglin_brute,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:piglin_brute,tag=moddyarena_wave]
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 8 of 10 within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 9 of 10 within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 9 cleared within 10s

@step wave 10 is the second boss, Captain Chop, and beating it wins
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 20s
@wait 1s
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:vindicator,tag=moddyarena_wave,name="Captain Chop"]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:vindicator,tag=moddyarena_wave,name="Captain Chop"]
execute store result score #hp arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:vindicator,tag=moddyarena_wave,name="Captain Chop",limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #hp arenatest matches 200
@expect bossbar BOSS: Captain Chop (wave 10 of 10) within 3s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title You won within 10s
@expect chat All 10 waves are cleared within 5s
@expect chat Your run: Won all 10 in within 3s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 15s
